      "bbox": {
        "l": 111.55,
        "t": 645.13,
        "r": 533.7849999999988,
        "b": 622.0600000000001
      },
      "content": "When placing new activated carbon filters, the outgoing water may initially look black (car bon dust). The carbon water is not harmful.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_846",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_4",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_4",
