      "bbox": {
        "l": 111.55,
        "t": 616.93,
        "r": 520.986,
        "b": 593.86
      },
      "content": "All filters, oil-containing tissues and water must be disposed of in an environmentally friendly and safe manner and in line with the local recommendations and environmental legislation.",
